# Project Rules: Modular CLI Next.js Application

This project is a modular CLI library that creates a scalable, plugin-based architecture for Next.js projects. Modules can be dynamically added, configured, or removed to extend application features, following strict standards to ensure maintainability and compatibility.

We have a skeleton project in which we will fit all the modules . 
Modules contains all the things which my require a functionality to be adapted by project , such as frontend components , hooks , handlers , server actions , API's and/or a database schema .